The CSV files under data/ are public catalog extracts and predicted-transit
tables, not original documentation:
- data/tabby_dr3.csv and data/controls_raw.csv are extracts from Gaia Data
  Release 3 (ESA/Gaia/DPAC). Use of Gaia data should follow the credit and
  citation guidelines at https://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/gaia/data-release-3
- data/gost_tabby_dr4window.csv is output from ESA's Gaia Observation Schedule
  Tool (GOST) for the planned DR4 time window.
